2. **Assertion robustness on a live game loop had to be derived twice** — hidden `#endOverlay` static text false-passed battle resolution (caught only by a workflow verify agent, b5b32c49), and exact-mana assertions raced regen (331fbab2); the cdp-cookbook carries none of this.
3. **~20 calls spent deriving environment facts that will recur** — background-tab rAF throttling, the Xvfb one-window-per-agent workaround, and tab-creation addressing in multi-tab instances (0399e382–8beea039); the cookbook documents tab addressing but not creation, throttling, or Xvfb.

**Proposal counts**: 3 skill-update (chrome-agent-testing SKILL.md qualitative-pass guidance; two cdp-cookbook sections; rohrpost Permission-denied fallback), 1 rule-update (AGENTS.md `## Subagent workflows`: teardown mandate, follow-up reconciliation, end-of-run checks), 1 acknowledge. All carry exact proposed text in the retro.

